ed. Resubmit share ledger, with updates, if any, with a certification not older than 3 months","notes":null},{"title":"Business Plan - organisational structure","tag":"Business Plan","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-20","description":"Submit full details of key persons involved. Compliance officer is omitted. Submit a management structure showing controls","notes":null},{"title":"Source of funds of business","tag":"Source of Funds","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-20","description":"Submit certified documentation as to how the business is funded and by whom, including certified documents which show funding/loans by the shareholder or third parties.","notes":null},{"title":"Financial Statements","tag":"Financial Audit","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-20","description":"Submit financials in whatever form signed by the director, for year ending 2023 as well as financials as aforesaid, which must not be older than 6 months","notes":null},{"title":"Player Registration","tag":"Player Registration","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-20","description":"The registration form does not require the player's name, address or DOB. This information must be collected at the latest prior to the first deposit. Kindly amend.","notes":null},{"title":"AML Policy","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-20","description":"The AML policy must adhere to Curacao AML laws. Kindly amend.","notes":null},{"title":"Server Location","tag":"Server Location","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-20","description":"The applicant has not answered Q16 of the OGLAF. Kindly confirm the location of the servers for the player account management platform, fill in the OGLAF and resubmit.","notes":null},{"title":"QPA/2024/00554 - Omar Hrik - SOW","tag":"Source of Wealth","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-20","description":"SOW is not valid. Please submit a SOW along with certified supporting evidence in order to support the business.","notes":null}]},{"name":"Responsible Gaming","criticality":"Critical","items":[{"title":"ID verification procedure","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"ID verification procedure","notes":null},{"title":"Account closure procedure","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Account closure procedure upon the operator becoming aware that the player is a minor post-registration.","notes":null},{"title":"Record-keeping","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Record-keeping","notes":null},{"title":"Contacting the operator","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Procedure on how the player can contact the operator regarding RG concerns via email or chat","notes":null},{"title":"Language","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Must be available in English and target market language","notes":null},{"title":"Vulnerable gamblers","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"RG policy should include a structured process on flagging potential vulnerable gamblers","notes":null},{"title":"Indicators of problem gambling","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Must have a structured process for responding to indicators of problem gambling","notes":null},{"title":"Player profiling and Risk Assessment","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Establish player profiles to assess risk levels","notes":null},{"title":"Monitoring and intervention","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Adopt RBA to determine level of monitoring and intervention","notes":null},{"title":"Recording RG interactions","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Record all RG interactions in PAM system","notes":null},{"title":"Identification of vulnerable persons","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Procedure to follow for players identified as vulnerable persons","notes":null},{"title":"Cooling-off period","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Operator must offer players option to activate a cooling-off period","notes":null},{"title":"Cooling-off options","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Options for cooling-off must include duration and marketing opt-out at minimum","notes":null},{"title":"Self-Exclusion","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Operator must offer players the option to self-exclude themselves for a duration of at least 1 year","notes":null},{"title":"Deposit Limits","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Players must be able to set limits on the total amount they deposit","notes":null},{"title":"Training and Staff Readiness","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Operators must train customer service and Responsible Gaming staff to handle player interaction profesionally and effectively","notes":null},{"title":"Consumer Advertising and Marketing","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Operators must not engage in irresponsible advertising","notes":null},{"title":"Internet Filtering Tools","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Low","due":"2026-06-04","description":"The operator is advised to remind adults that they should take precautions when sharing devices with minors","notes":null},{"title":"Notifications for concerning behaviours","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"High","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Operators may employ automatic or manual pop-up notifications in response to concerning behaviours","notes":null},{"title":"Initiating direct contact","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-04","description":"When a player exhibits behaviour that reasonably suggests they may be a Vulnerable Player, the operator must initiate direct contact","notes":null},{"title":"Other Limits","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"High","due":"2026-06-04","description":"Other limits may be considered including loss limits, time limits or wager limits, in line wth the operator's target player and/or market","notes":null}]}]}]}